<title>SINGAPORE: ST Aerospace sees better 1997.</title>
<headline>ST Aerospace sees better 1997.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Singapore Technologies Aerospace Ltd said on Monday it expected to perform better in 1997 over the previous year.</p>
<p>The group returned to profits with a net gain of Singapore $27.84 million for the year ended December 31 1996 against a loss of S$48.35 million in 1995.  </p>
<p>The group's 1996 profit far exceeded market expectations.</p>
<p>Analysts polled in the Estimate Directory gave a concensus forecast of S$18.2 million for the group. The forecasts ranged from S$26 million on the high end to $16.6 million at the low end.</p>
</text>
